<http://data.silknow.org/object/fa83fee1-fccb-3651-abef-bfae5d950f22/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Heavy symmetrical leafy ogee-type grid framing blossoms in 6-lobed medallions in white on a yellow background. The medallion in the center of the fabric holds a phoenix rising from a pyre bearing a scroll \"NORS VIVE\" in mirror imaged letters. Pattern embellished with red, green, and blue details in uncut pile loops. The white was cut-pile velvet, now mostly worn off; the yellow 1/2 twill."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/fa83fee1-fccb-3651-abef-bfae5d950f22> .

